{
  "version": 1,
  "id": 5,
  "name": {
    "ja": "塔",
    "en": "The Tower",
  },
  "definition": {
    "type": "TOWER",
    "level": 40,
    "flags": ["PRESET", "TOWER"],
  },
  "descriptions": [
    {
      "when": {
        "statusAtMost": "COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "街の外にある塔はかつて街の守備に使われていました。",
          "今ではたくさんのモンスターが住み付いているようです。",
          "どうかモンスターどもを一掃して塔を取り戻してください！",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The tower outside the town was once used for defence of the city.",
          "Now many monsters seem to be dwelling there.",
          "Please clear it and return to us!",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "STAGE_COMPLETED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "街の外にある塔はかつて街の守備に使われていました。",
          "今ではたくさんのモンスターが住み付いているようです。",
          "どうかモンスターどもを一掃して塔を取り戻してください！",
        ],
        "en": [
          "The tower outside the town was once used for defence of the city.",
          "Now many monsters seem to be dwelling there.",
          "Please clear it and return to us!",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "REWARDED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "塔の怪物を一掃して下さって有難うございます。この街の司書のアスティヌス、",
          "武器匠の水庵、モンスター仙人のロリエンに話を付けておいたので、",
          "今後これらの店では格安でサービスを受けられるでしょう。",
          "加えて、ささやかなお礼を外に用意しておきました。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "Thank you for cleaning the tower of all these strange creatures.",
          "I've talked with Astinus, the local librarian, Suiyan, the local",
          "weaponmaster, and Lorien, the local beastmaster. They will offer you",
          "a special discount price when they serve you, and a small reward",
          "awaits you outside.",
        ],
      },
    },
    {
      "when": {
        "status": "FAILED",
      },
      "text": {
        "ja": [
          "この仕事はあなたには難しかったようですね。他の冒険者を雇って",
          "残りのモンスターを退治しますから、もういいですよ。",
        ],
        "en": [
          "It seems like this task was too difficult for you.  Good that I",
          "hired another adventurer to clean up the remaining monsters.",
        ],
      },
    },
  ],
